[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the car is fitted with an Air\nBag system, before working on it, it is essential to carry out the\nfollowing preliminary operations: (1) turn the ignition off and\nremove the key; (2) disconnect the battery termnals and insulate\nthem; (3) wait at least 10 minutes before proceeding.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nFULES (\n                                                         <a href=\"#/2753006\">5580C</a>\n                                                          ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753156\">7030B34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753206\">7040H16</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the sun roof wiring connection.</p><p>2. Disconnect the connection for the sun roof control switch.</p><p>3. Disconnect the connection for the sun roof motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Sun roof control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>M95</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Release the wiring from the retaining bands and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047117.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Secure the wiring to the retaining\nbands.</p><p>Connect the sun roof motor connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Sun roof control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>M95</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the sun roof control switch connection.</p><p>Connect the sun roof wiring connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753206\">7040H16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753156\">7030B34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p><p>After the battery has been disconnected or a fuse has blown, the system must be initialized again, proceeding as follows:</p><ul><li>press the switch in the &#x27;roof closed&#x27; position;</li><li>keep the switch pressed: the roof will close in stages;</li><li>keeping the switch pressed, wait for the roof to close fully\nuntil the motor is stopped;</li><li>release the switch.</li></ul>"]]